My experience (when I tested this on some old documents written in
AMS-LaTeX) is that the all is wery slow (and it was more and more
slow during the run - for example first 22 pages of the document
take about one minute, then it is more and more slow and then page
47 takes more then 2 minuts), linebreaking and pagebreaking differ
slightly from the original and the extensible arrows do not work.
I decided to wait for the new distribution of AMS-LaTeX.
